post_install() {
  cat <<'MSG'

GambleLand installed. To put the configs in your home directory, run as your
own user (not root):

    gambleland-setup

Then log out and pick the "GambleLand" session in your display manager.
MSG
}

post_upgrade() {
  cat <<'MSG'

GambleLand updated. The files under /usr/share/gambleland changed; your copies
in ~/.config did not. To take the new version:

    gambleland-setup --force     # backs up your current ~/.config/{hypr,quickshell}

MSG
}
